---
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import WorkingGraph from '../../components/WorkingGraph.jsx';
import published from '../../../public/legacy/0.20260206e/tensor.core.graph.json';
import graph from '../../../public/graphs/working/tensor.core.graph.json';
import criteria from '../../../public/graphs/working/entry-evidence-criteria.json';
import source from '../../../public/core/0.1.0-draft.1/provenance.json';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { absoluteUrl, seo } from '../../data/seo';

const meta = seo.graphs;
const siteUrl = Astro.site?.toString() || 'https://tensor-standards.pages.dev/';
const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'TechArticle',
  headline: meta.title,
  description: meta.description,
  url: absoluteUrl(siteUrl, meta.canonicalPath),
};
---

<BaseLayout title={meta.title} description={meta.description} canonicalPath={meta.canonicalPath} ogType={meta.ogType} jsonLd={jsonLd} hidePageTitle>
  <section class="atlas-page" aria-label="Investigation graph workspace">
    <WorkingGraph published={published} graph={graph} criteria={criteria} source={source} client:load />
    <div class="atlas-coverage" id="coverage">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">Public investigation knowledge</p><h2>Questions, evidence criteria,<br />and routes.</h2><p>The working graph contains <strong>{graph.nodes.length} questions across seven domains</strong>. All 588 original IDs are included, with revised definitions and 21 additional repair questions. Event profiles add explicit contexts for different kinds of activity and state.</p></div>
      <div><div class="atlas-lineage"><div>588<small>Published questions</small></div><span>→</span><div>609<small>Working questions</small></div><span>+</span><div>16<small>Event profiles</small></div></div><p>The working draft has an item-level review by separate AI reviewers, with independently authored challenges. Institutional and field validation remain separate. The coverage ledger records the original wording, revisions, evidence changes, and external review status.</p><div class="cta-group"><Button variant="primary" href="/graphs/profiles/">Event profiles</Button><Button variant="secondary" href="/graphs/review/">Question and route review</Button><Button variant="secondary" href="/graphs/coverage/">Coverage ledger</Button><Button variant="secondary" href="/extensions/">Vendor and organization layers</Button></div></div>
    </div>
    <noscript><p>The question list and evidence criteria below work without JavaScript. Enable JavaScript for the node canvas and focused inspector.</p></noscript>
    <details class="tensor-panel graph-static-outline"><summary>Complete working graph and criteria · text view</summary><ol>{graph.nodes.map((node) => <li id={`working-${node.id}`}><h3>{node.label}</h3><p>{node.text}</p><dl>{Object.entries(criteria.rules[criteria.nodes[node.id].rule]).map(([answer, text]) => <div><dt>{answer}</dt><dd>{text}</dd></div>)}</dl><ul>{graph.edges.filter((edge) => edge.source === node.id).map((edge) => <li>{edge.decision} → <a href={`#working-${edge.target}`}>{graph.nodes.find(n=>n.id===edge.target)?.text}</a></li>)}</ul></li>)}</ol></details>
    <details class="tensor-panel graph-static-outline"><summary>Complete published graph · 588 questions · text view</summary><ol>{published.nodes.map((node) => <li id={`published-${node.id}`}><h3>{node.label}</h3><p>{node.text}</p><ul>{published.edges.filter((edge) => edge.source === node.id).map((edge) => <li>{edge.decision} → <a href={`#published-${edge.target}`}>{published.nodes.find(n=>n.id===edge.target)?.text}</a></li>)}</ul></li>)}</ol></details>
    <section class="tensor-panel graph-static-outline" aria-labelledby="graph-resources-title"><h2 id="graph-resources-title">Graph resources</h2><ul><li><a href="/studio/">Graph Studio · graph and layer import/export</a></li><li><a href="/extensions/">Vendor and organization layering guide</a></li><li><a href="/questions/">Published question catalog and citations</a></li><li><a href="/assets/releases/manifest.json">Published release manifest</a></li><li><a href="/schemas/">JSON Schemas</a> · <a href="/metrics/">Historical graph metrics</a></li></ul></section>
    <p class="graph-downloads"><a href="/graphs/working/tensor.core.graph.json" download>Working graph JSON</a> · <a href="/graphs/working/entry-evidence-criteria.json" download>Evidence criteria JSON</a> · <a href="/investigation-lab/">Investigation Lab · recorded paths</a></p>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.graph-static-outline { padding: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
.graph-static-outline summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent-primary); }
.graph-static-outline ol { padding: 1rem 0 0 1.5rem; }
.graph-static-outline ol > li { padding: 1rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft); scroll-margin-top: 7rem; }
.graph-static-outline dl { margin: .7rem 0; font-size: .85rem; }
.graph-static-outline dt { font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-primary); }
.graph-static-outline ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
.graph-downloads { margin: 1.2rem 0 2rem; font-size: .9rem; }
</style>
